    "history_recall": "Of scenarios with multiple submission attempts, count cases with history.attached event whose detail records a previous version >= 1.",
    "escalation": "Recorded exception-routed scenarios / all recorded cases. Not the correctness of escalation absent independent escalation labels.",
    "cove_claims": "verification.result events from the scripted supplier replay. The legacy fixture verifies Opponent structured claims, not Proponent text independently. These are not real model hallucination rates.",
    "human_gate": "Valid-intake cases with reached_gate true / all valid-intake cases; does not mean a human approved.",
    "trace_availability": "Recorded cases with nonempty event arrays; not an audit-trace completeness assessment."
